      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s early economy boomed with hotels, a national bank, a washing‑machine factory, a tannery, a cottonseed oil mill, and artesian waterworks.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
